    "detailed_description": "&quot;Abomin-Agency! is a party game for 3 to 8 players set in Dr. Frankenstein's Monster-Building Factory in the not-so-distant future. Clients from all over come to Dr. Frankenstein's factory for custom-tailored monsters, and players compete for their business. Each player receives a slew of monster body parts and are tasked with designing the best monster for the job in order to earn their next big pay day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPLEASE NOTE: Abomin-Agency! is a local multiplayer game that can also be played with remote players online (VERY easily). It's perfect for Online Game Nights, Community Game Streams, Virtual Happy Hours, etc.!&quot;",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Abomin-Agency! is a party game for 3 to 8 players set in Dr. Frankenstein's Monster-Building Factory in the not-so-distant future. Clients from all over come to Dr. Frankenstein's factory for custom-tailored monsters, and players compete for their business. Each player receives a slew of monster body parts and are tasked with designing the best monster for the job in order to earn their next big pay day.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPLEASE NOTE: Abomin-Agency! is a local multiplayer game that can also be played with remote players online (VERY easily). It's perfect for Online Game Nights, Community Game Streams, Virtual Happy Hours, etc.!&quot;",
